:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"簡單推理常用到三個要素：❶觀察線索；❷背景知識；❸進行推論。我們可以用下圖來表示：","n":41,"ssz":"........1................................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].referent","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"推理三要素流程圖","n":8,"ssz":"........"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"推理三要素","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].description","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"方塊流程圖：左側上下兩個框「觀察線索」與「背景知識」，中間以 ✚ 相連，\n往右一個箭頭指向「進行推論」（上方黑底標籤「思考」），\n再以 ＝ 指向「推理結果」（上方黑底標籤「產出」）。","n":91,"ssz":"...........1.....................1.....11.................................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].description#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"方塊流程圖：左側上下兩個框「觀察線索」與「背景知識」，中間以 ✚ 相連，","n":36,"ssz":"...........1.....................1.."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].description#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"往右一個箭頭指向「進行推論」（上方黑底標籤「思考」），","n":27,"ssz":"..11......................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].description#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"再以 ＝ 指向「推理結果」（上方黑底標籤「產出」）。","n":26,"ssz":".........................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"一、看福爾摩斯如何推理","n":11,"ssz":"..........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"推理能力可以透過訓練提升，我們先用福爾摩斯的帽子推理，看看三個要素運作的細節。","n":39,"ssz":".......................1......1........"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"❶細心觀察線索：關於帽主的訊息，福爾摩斯觀察到：\n1.固定鬆緊帶的小圓環是請【　】製作的、襯裡用料【　】，還帶有一條【　】的絲綢箍帶。\n2.鬆緊帶壞了卻沒有換，帽子的補丁處用墨水【　】。","n":93,"ssz":"........................................................2........................1..........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].prompt#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"❶細心觀察線索：關於帽主的訊息，福爾摩斯觀察到：","n":24,"ssz":"........................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].prompt#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"1.固定鬆緊帶的小圓環是請【　】製作的、襯裡用料【　】，還帶有一條【　】的絲綢箍帶。","n":42,"ssz":"...............................2.........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].prompt#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"2.鬆緊帶壞了卻沒有換，帽子的補丁處用墨水【　】。","n":25,"ssz":".............1..........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].blanks[0].answer","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"專人","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].blanks[1].answer","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"高級","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].blanks[2].answer","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"精緻","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].blanks[3].answer","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"染黑","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[5].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"❷連結背景知識 ❸進行推論","n":13,"ssz":"............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[6].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"對以上的線索，福爾摩斯連結到許多背景知識，並進行推論：\n先備知識：帽子是【　】款式；專人製作、用料高級，價格通常【　】","n":59,"ssz":"..................................1........................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[6].prompt#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"對以上的線索，福爾摩斯連結到許多背景知識，並進行推論：","n":27,"ssz":"..........................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[6].prompt#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"先備知識：帽子是【　】款式；專人製作、用料高級，價格通常【　】","n":31,"ssz":"......1........................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[6].blanks[0].answer","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"三年前","n":3,"ssz":"..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[6].blanks[1].answer","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"不便宜","n":3,"ssz":"1.."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[7].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"推論：帽主三年前是有錢人。","n":13,"ssz":"............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"二、小試身手：你來試試看","n":12,"ssz":"............"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[9].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"接下來有兩個情境，都有點挑戰，請你利用觀察力與背景知識，試著推論看看！","n":35,"ssz":".....1............................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[10].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"（一）推論人的個性：福爾摩斯能推測出帽主「家道中落」，是比較容易理解的。但是為什麼福爾摩斯還可以進一步推論帽主的個性，說帽主「不想讓人看出來（家道中落）」、「力圖保持體面」呢？他觀察到什麼線索？連結了什麼背景知識？請推論出最可能的選項。","n":118,"ssz":".......1..............................1..........1......1............................................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[11].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"觀察線索（選１項）：","n":10,"ssz":".........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[11].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"鬆緊帶壞了，也沒有換新","n":11,"ssz":"..........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[11].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"補丁的地方，用墨水塗黑","n":11,"ssz":"..........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[12].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"背景知識（選１項）：","n":10,"ssz":".........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[12].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"鬆緊帶壞了反而比較好用舒服","n":13,"ssz":"............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[12].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"用墨水塗黑就比較看不出補丁","n":13,"ssz":"............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[13].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"福爾摩斯的推論：他買不起新帽子，把舊帽破損處補丁，不想讓人看見，所以塗上墨水，以保持自己的【　】。","n":49,"ssz":"..............1.................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[14].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"（二）停電夜的真相","n":9,"ssz":"........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[15].paragraphs[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"不久前，伊藤的管家頭部受到重擊而亡，中村警官找伊藤問話。燭光中，伊藤顫抖著從冰箱取了些冰塊，並往威士忌加冰塊。","n":55,"ssz":"......................................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[15].paragraphs[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"「我以為他是強盜。」伊藤喝著威士忌說：「三天前這裡開始停電，我就暫時搬去城裡住。大概兩小時前，我回來拿一些資料，就在我開抽屜時，他跳到我的身後。我現在猜想可能他以為我是小偷，而我在黑暗中，則以為是一個歹徒在攻擊我，當時我只想到自保，就拿起木棍全力反擊，擊中了他，他倒退幾步後就倒下了，然後我就報警了。」","n":151,"ssz":"...................................................2..............................................11..................................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[15].paragraphs[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"中村警官：「老實交代吧！我不想聽你編故事。」","n":22,"ssz":"......................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[15].underlined_terms[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"伊藤","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[15].underlined_terms[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"中村","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[16].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"（在【 】中填入適當推理步驟：觀察線索、背景知識、進行推論。）","n":31,"ssz":".........1....................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[17].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"問題：中村警官判斷伊藤沒有說實話的理由是什麼？","n":23,"ssz":"......................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[17].columns[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"推理步驟","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[17].columns[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"內容","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[17].rows[0].推理步驟_blanks[0].answer","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"觀察線索","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[17].rows[0].內容","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"伊藤從冰箱拿冰塊。","n":9,"ssz":"........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[17].rows[1].推理步驟_blanks[0].answer","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"背景知識","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[17].rows[1].內容","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"冰箱的冰塊停電８小時左右就會融化。","n":17,"ssz":"................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[17].rows[2].推理步驟_blanks[0].answer","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"進行推論","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[17].rows[2].內容","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"三天前開始停電，本案發生時，冰塊早該融光了，但伊藤喝酒卻能加冰塊？","n":33,"ssz":"................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[18].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"最後推論","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[18].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"伊藤很愛